      "sentences": [
        \{
          "index": 1,
          "text": "本节将 Results 中的发现置于更广阔的教育不平等文献语境中，探讨这些文献计量学模式所蕴含的学科智识成熟度、结构性分裂与范式演替意涵。",
          "function": "transition",
          "tense": "future",
          "confidence": "high",
          "relations": \{
            "outgoing": [
              \{"target": 2, "relation": "elaborated\_by"\}
            ]
          \},
          "data\_anchors": []
        \},
        \{
          "index": 2,
          "text": "本文的核心命题是：教育不平等研究已进入一个“范式内演化”阶段——其概念核心高度凝聚，但经典理论框架的影响力正在衰退，知识生产的地理与网络结构呈现显著的碎片化，尽管学术产出总量仍在增长。",
          "function": "claim",
          "tense": "present",
          "confidence": "high",
          "relations": \{
            "outgoing": [
              \{"target": 3, "relation": "elaborated\_by"\}
            ]
          \},
          "data\_anchors": []
        \},
        \{
          "index": 3,
          "text": "支撑这一命题的证据来自增长模型、产出分布、合作网络、话语结构和知识基础五个维度。",
          "function": "transition",
          "tense": "present",
          "confidence": "high",
          "relations": \{
            "outgoing": []
          \},
          "data\_anchors": []
        \},
        \{
          "index": 4,
          "text": "教育不平等研究的产出增长轨迹描绘了一个领域对全球政策议程的深度响应。",
          "function": "claim",
          "tense": "present",
          "confidence": "moderate",
          "relations": \{
            "outgoing": [
              \{"target": 5, "relation": "supported\_by"\}
            ]
          \},
          "data\_anchors": []
        \},
        \{
          "index": 5,
          "text": "拟合 Logistic 增长模型（R²=0.9514，[待替换: SC标记\#2].4）揭示了该领域并非经历无序膨胀，而是遵循从指数增长到趋于饱和的 S 型演化路径。",
          "function": "evidence",
          "tense": "present",
          "confidence": "high",
          "relations": \{
            "outgoing": [
              \{"target": 6, "relation": "continues\_from"\},
              \{"target": 4, "relation": "supported\_by"\}
            ]
          \},
          "data\_anchors": [
            \{"target": "[待替换: SC标记\#2].4", "type": "brief\_conclusion", "spec": "Logistic增长模型拟合R²=0.9514"\}
          ]
        \},
        \{
          "index": 6,
          "text": "该模型的拐点位于 2020 年前后，这恰好与 2015 年后可持续发展目标 4（SDG 4）及“不让一个孩子掉队”（No Child Left Behind）等全球性教育公平政策框架的强力推动形成时间上的耦合。",
          "function": "elaboration",
          "tense": "present",
          "confidence": "tentative",
          "relations": \{
            "outgoing": [
              \{"target": 5, "relation": "deepens"\},
              \{"target": 7, "relation": "turns\_from"\}
            ]
          \},
          "data\_anchors": [
            \{"target": "MC-2", "type": "brief\_conclusion", "spec": "Logistic增长模型拐点2020年前后"\}
          ]
        \},
        \{
          "index": 7,
          "text": "然而，将该领域的成熟度简单等同于模型拟合的数值进度是危险的。",
          "function": "hedging",
          "tense": "present",
          "confidence": "high",
          "relations": \{
            "outgoing": [
              \{"target": 8, "relation": "supported\_by"\}
            ]
          \},
          "data\_anchors": []
        \},
        \{
          "index": 8,
          "text": "根据 Price 定律，Logistic 曲线的后半段（即当前的“成熟期”）往往意味着增量知识的边际贡献递减。",
          "function": "evidence",
