          "data\_anchors": [
            \{"target": "[待替换: SC标记\#6].1", "type": "brief\_conclusion", "spec": "核心三角总被引频次310次"\}
          ]
        \},
        \{
          "index": 3,
          "text": "然而，引用轨迹分析（[待替换: SC标记\#6].2, [待替换: SC标记\#6].5）显示，这些经典的引用曲线已普遍达到 Logistic 模型预测的平台期，甚至在 2020 年后呈现下降趋势。",
          "function": "contrast",
          "tense": "present",
          "confidence": "high",
          "relations": \{
            "outgoing": [
              \{"target": 2, "relation": "contrasted\_with"\},
              \{"target": 4, "relation": "elaborated\_by"\}
            ]
          \},
          "data\_anchors": [
            \{"target": "[待替换: SC标记\#6].2", "type": "brief\_conclusion", "spec": "引用轨迹达到平台期"\},
            \{"target": "[待替换: SC标记\#6].5", "type": "brief\_conclusion", "spec": "引用轨迹在2020年后下降"\}
          ]
        \},
        \{
          "index": 4,
          "text": "可以推论，它们已转变为一种“学术化石”——其历史奠基作用依然被承认，但对前沿研究的设计和解释不再提供直接的理论驱动力。",
          "function": "elaboration",
          "tense": "present",
          "confidence": "tentative",
          "relations": \{
            "outgoing": [
              \{"target": 5, "relation": "elaborated\_by"\}
            ]
          \},
          "data\_anchors": []
        \},
        \{
          "index": 5,
          "text": "这一现象与 Kuhn 的范式转换理论具有启发性的关联：随着既有框架的预测力被穷尽，领域内势必产生对替代性框架的需求。",
          "function": "elaboration",
          "tense": "present",
          "confidence": "tentative",
          "relations": \{
            "outgoing": [
              \{"target": 6, "relation": "elaborated\_by"\}
            ]
          \},
          "data\_anchors": []
        \},
        \{
          "index": 6,
          "text": "一些新兴变量，如“居住隔离”和“学校选择”，预示着研究议程正转向具体的制度机制。",
          "function": "evidence",
          "tense": "present",
          "confidence": "moderate",
          "relations": \{
            "outgoing": []
          \},
          "data\_anchors": [
            \{"target": "MC-5", "type": "brief\_conclusion", "spec": "新兴变量指向具体制度机制"\}
